{{!< default}}

<section class="info-hero">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <div class="page-identity">
      <img class="page-identity-mark" src="{{asset "images/download (25).jpg"}}" alt="Garcia Law Office and Notary Public seal logo">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Information</p>
        <h1 class="page-title">Clear guidance, careful preparation.</h1>
      </div>
    </div>
    <p class="info-lede">Good legal work starts with context. These notes explain how we work, what to prepare, and what you can expect when you contact the office.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="information-sections section-border">
  <div class="container information-grid">
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p>
      <h2>Practical advice in plain language.</h2>
      <p>We listen first, identify the legal and factual issues, and explain the available options before recommending a next step. Our goal is to help you make informed decisions with a clear view of the process, timing, and possible risks.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">What to expect</p>
      <h2>A structured first meeting.</h2>
      <p>The first consultation focuses on understanding your concern and determining how the office may assist. Depending on the matter, the next step may be document review, a written opinion, negotiation, notarial work, or formal representation.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="information-sections section-border">
  <div class="container information-grid">
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">How we may help</p>
      <h2>Support for important legal decisions.</h2>
      <p>The office may assist with legal consultations, contracts and agreements, document review, notarial services, property concerns, family matters, business questions, negotiation, and formal representation when appropriate.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">A careful process</p>
      <h2>Facts first, next steps second.</h2>
      <p>Every matter begins with listening and review. The office considers the relevant facts, documents, deadlines, and desired outcome before explaining possible options, risks, fees, and the recommended next step.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="information-list-section">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">After you contact the office</p>
    <div class="information-list">
      <div><span>01</span><p>Send your name, contact details, a short description of the concern, and your preferred schedule.</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><p>The office may ask for additional details or documents to understand whether the matter can be assisted.</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><p>An initial consultation or document review may be recommended depending on the concern.</p></div>
      <div><span>04</span><p>The office will explain the proposed scope of work, applicable fees, and what information is still needed.</p></div>
      <div><span>05</span><p>An engagement begins only after the office formally accepts the matter and the agreed terms are clear.</p></div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="information-sections section-border">
  <div class="container information-grid">
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">Before visiting</p>
      <h2>Bring records that tell the story.</h2>
      <p>Prepare identification and copies of contracts, notices, receipts, titles, messages, photographs, or other relevant records. Arrange them by date and note any deadline, hearing, payment, or meeting that may affect the matter.</p>
    </article>
    <article>
      <p class="eyebrow">Urgent concerns</p>
      <h2>Tell us when time matters.</h2>
      <p>Make deadlines, court notices, demands, threatened action, safety concerns, or expiring agreements clear when you contact the office. If there is immediate danger, contact the appropriate emergency authorities first.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="information-list-section">
  <div class="container container-narrow">
    <p class="eyebrow">Helpful reminders</p>
    <div class="information-list">
      <div><span>01</span><p>Bring original documents when possible, together with clear copies for review.</p></div>
      <div><span>02</span><p>Do not sign an agreement, waiver, affidavit, or settlement while important terms remain unclear.</p></div>
      <div><span>03</span><p>Tell us about deadlines and previous legal advice so urgent issues can be prioritized properly.</p></div>
      <div><span>04</span><p>Fees and scope depend on the nature, complexity, and urgency of the service requested.</p></div>
    </div>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href="{{@site.url}}/contact/">Contact the office</a>
  </div>
</section>
